---
/**
 * The two sensing chains feeding the controller, typeset as an inline SVG.
 * Values are the measured calibration numbers from the report.
 */
---

<figure>
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 720 260"
    role="img"
    aria-label="Signal chain diagram with two lanes feeding the controller. Moisture lane: a capacitive soil probe into a 12 bit analog to digital converter, into a Kalman filter with empirically tuned noise, into a mapping from 1210 counts submerged and 2523 counts in air onto an approximate 10 to 50 percent volumetric water content scale. Reservoir lane: an ultrasonic rangefinder driven by timer interrupts with edge capture, into a least squares time of flight fit, into a four sample moving average, into a two point level calibration giving 0 to 100 percent. Both lanes feed the four state controller."
    style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--rule)"
  >
    <defs>
      <marker id="lsd-arrow" viewBox="0 0 8 8" refX="7" refY="4" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 z" fill="var(--ink-muted)"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <g font-family="var(--mono)" font-size="12" fill="var(--ink)">
      <!-- moisture lane -->
      <g>
        <rect x="20" y="40" width="120" height="44" fill="var(--wash)" stroke="var(--rule-strong)"></rect>
        <text x="80" y="58" text-anchor="middle">capacitive</text>
        <text x="80" y="74" text-anchor="middle">probe</text>

        <rect x="180" y="40" width="100" height="44" fill="var(--wash)" stroke="var(--rule-strong)"></rect>
        <text x="230" y="66" text-anchor="middle">12-bit ADC</text>

        <rect x="320" y="40" width="110" height="44" fill="var(--wash)" stroke="var(--rule-strong)"></rect>
        <text x="375" y="58" text-anchor="middle">Kalman</text>
        <text x="375" y="74" text-anchor="middle">filter</text>

        <rect x="470" y="40" width="140" height="44" fill="var(--wash)" stroke="var(--rule-strong)"></rect>
        <text x="540" y="58" text-anchor="middle">1210..2523 counts</text>
        <text x="540" y="74" text-anchor="middle">to 10..50% VWC</text>
      </g>

      <!-- reservoir lane -->
      <g>
        <rect x="20" y="140" width="120" height="44" fill="var(--wash)" stroke="var(--rule-strong)"></rect>
        <text x="80" y="158" text-anchor="middle">ultrasonic</text>
        <text x="80" y="174" text-anchor="middle">rangefinder</text>

        <rect x="180" y="140" width="100" height="44" fill="var(--wash)" stroke="var(--rule-strong)"></rect>
        <text x="230" y="158" text-anchor="middle">timer +</text>
        <text x="230" y="174" text-anchor="middle">edge capture</text>

        <rect x="320" y="140" width="110" height="44" fill="var(--wash)" stroke="var(--rule-strong)"></rect>
        <text x="375" y="158" text-anchor="middle">least-squares</text>
        <text x="375" y="174" text-anchor="middle">ToF fit</text>

        <rect x="470" y="140" width="140" height="44" fill="var(--wash)" stroke="var(--rule-strong)"></rect>
        <text x="540" y="158" text-anchor="middle">4-sample average,</text>
        <text x="540" y="174" text-anchor="middle">0..100% level</text>
      </g>

      <!-- controller -->
      <rect x="640" y="90" width="60" height="94" fill="var(--wash)" stroke="var(--rule-strong)"></rect>
      <text x="670" y="130" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">FSM</text>
      <text x="670" y="146" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="var(--ink-muted)">500 ms</text>

      <!-- arrows -->
      <g stroke="var(--ink-muted)" fill="none" stroke-width="1.25" marker-end="url(#lsd-arrow)">
        <line x1="140" y1="62" x2="176" y2="62"></line>
        <line x1="280" y1="62" x2="316" y2="62"></line>
        <line x1="430" y1="62" x2="466" y2="62"></line>
        <line x1="610" y1="62" x2="636" y2="104"></line>
        <line x1="140" y1="162" x2="176" y2="162"></line>
        <line x1="280" y1="162" x2="316" y2="162"></line>
        <line x1="430" y1="162" x2="466" y2="162"></line>
        <line x1="610" y1="162" x2="636" y2="168"></line>
      </g>

      <!-- lane labels -->
      <g font-size="10" fill="var(--ink-muted)" letter-spacing="1.5">
        <text x="20" y="28">SOIL MOISTURE</text>
        <text x="20" y="128">RESERVOIR LEVEL</text>
      </g>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    The two sensing chains. Moisture is filtered to under 1 percent variation
    sample to sample and mapped onto a physically possible scale; reservoir
    level is fitted against measured heights rather than the nominal speed of
    sound.
    <span class="figcaption__source">Source: measured calibration values from the report.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>
